backend/predictor/research/test_data/

# Pure-data JSON. tree-sitter-json yields no symbols for a data file, so each of
# these is stamped in the manifest with no node in the graph and re-queued on
# every run as a "prior failed extraction" (graphify #2543) — 113 files did
# that. Only the data files are listed: the 10 JSON files that *do* carry
# structure (task/case JSON *schemas*, agent_profiles/*/profile.json,
# opencode/toxagent.json, package.json, tsconfig*.json) stay indexed.
